      "description": "A scene depicting a person making a face of discomfort or distress while chopping onions, with hands framing their eyes. The text 'when you chop onions' is overlaid, indicating the cause of the discomfort. The scene is centered on the person's exaggerated reaction to a common, relatable kitchen experience.",
